{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "HALLOW BLADE",
    "steam_appid": 3772190,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772190/extras/b6d5ac5ee0e35e17895d1f8eb207a7dc.avif?t=1748705918\" data-has-big width=800 height=147 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Hallow Blade</i> you take on the role of a lonely wandering knight that stumbles upon a lost kingdom and within it - the <i>Hallow Blade</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bound by fate to the blade, you must hunt powerful foes and feed their souls to it - strengthening and evolving it, until it reaches its true form capable of destroying the ancient curse looming over the kingdom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic first-person combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slash, parry and dodge your enemies in strategic first-person sword combat influenced by your movement. Weave in attacks by your other melee- and ranged weapons to kill enemies effectively.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gear up for the unknown</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new equipment and abilities that change how you engage with world and how you approach enemy encounters. Equip magical rings and other tools to define your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A vast interconnected underworld</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master navigating the underworld by exploring utility-gated areas using your equipment, abilities, and weapons. Discover shortcuts and restore broken clocktowers to build a network of fast-travel destinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>To lift the blade is to wager your soul.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Feed the blade.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772190/extras/b6d5ac5ee0e35e17895d1f8eb207a7dc.avif?t=1748705918\" data-has-big width=800 height=147 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Hallow Blade</i> you take on the role of a lonely wandering knight that stumbles upon a lost kingdom and within it - the <i>Hallow Blade</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bound by fate to the blade, you must hunt powerful foes and feed their souls to it - strengthening and evolving it, until it reaches its true form capable of destroying the ancient curse looming over the kingdom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic first-person combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slash, parry and dodge your enemies in strategic first-person sword combat influenced by your movement. Weave in attacks by your other melee- and ranged weapons to kill enemies effectively.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gear up for the unknown</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new equipment and abilities that change how you engage with world and how you approach enemy encounters. Equip magical rings and other tools to define your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A vast interconnected underworld</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master navigating the underworld by exploring utility-gated areas using your equipment, abilities, and weapons. Discover shortcuts and restore broken clocktowers to build a network of fast-travel destinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>To lift the blade is to wager your soul.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Feed the blade.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "HALLOW BLADE is a dark fantasy action adventure set in a vast interconnected subterranean kingdom where you form an unbreakable bond with an ancient possessed sword hungry for souls and vengeance.",
